{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_2026052323565415e9ae792e57459b","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I have the cookies from the tma CLI session. I can use these cookies to make Playwright log into the Douyin developer platform. Let me create a new Playwright script that:\n1. Sets these cookies in the browser context\n2. Navigates to the game management page\n3. Fills in the basic info\n\nLet me also check the Douyin API docs to see if there's an API endpoint for setting basic info directly.\n\nActually, let me first try to use the API approach. Looking at the cookies, I have session cookies. Let me try using the open-douyin API to set the basic info.\n\nActually, the most direct approach is to use Playwright with the cookies set. Let me write a comprehensive script.\n\nBut first, let me understand what the \"基本信息\" page looks like. The task says I need to fill in:\n- 名称：消消消大作战\n- 简介：经典三消益智小游戏\n- 图标：上传生成的图标\n- 服务类目：选择游戏类目\n\nThe URL is: https://developer.open-douyin.com/game-console/1065926/game-manage\n\nLet me try using the API first since we have the cookies. The Douyin API has endpoints for managing mini games.\n\nActually, let me check if there's an API endpoint I can use. Let me search for relevant API docs.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"706396d6-ec59-4233-944d-f5f71f1c7830","uuid":"1013e375-e8cb-410e-9d8c-816229bda5f0"}
