zh-CN/thirdparty/API/smallprogram/auth-app-manage/base-info/modify-intro\", \"content\": \"接口介绍该接口用于第三方小程序应用为授权小程序修改简介。 *请求*基本信息* *查询参数* *请求体（json） * *请求体示例*响应*响应体* *响应体示例* ...\", \"refer\": \"ref_1\"}, {\"title\"...\n                                                根据我的搜索结果，以下是关于**抖音开放平台小游戏修改基本信息API**的相关信息汇总：\n\n---\n\n## 搜索结果总结\n\n### 1. 抖音开放平台目前**没有**名为 `set_app_info` 的公开API\n\n在抖音开放平台的官方文档中，**没有找到名为 `set_app_info` 的服务端接口**。这可能是其他平台（如微信开放平台）的接口名称，或者是开发者自定义的接口。\n\n---\n\n### 2. 自研小游戏修改基本信息的方式\n\n根据官方文档，自研小游戏修改基础信息的方式是**通过开放平台控制台操作**，而非API调用：\n\n> 已完成相关基础信息填写的小游戏可通过以下路径查看或修改基础信息：左侧菜单栏「**设置 → 基础设置**」点击【编辑】按钮进入基础设置编辑页面。\n\n📄 参考文档：[创建与信息完善_小游戏](https://developer.open-douyin.com/docs/resource/zh-CN/mini-game/guide/minigame/improve-information)\n\n---\n\n### 3. 第三方平台代开发的修改信息API\n\n如果你是通过**第三方平台代开发**模式，抖音开放平台提供了以下服务端API来修改授权小程序/小游戏的基本信息（路径均在 `auth-app-manage/base-info/` 下）：\n\n| API | 说明 | 文档链接 |\n|-----|------|----------|\n| 修改小程序简介 | 为授权小程序修改简介 | [修改小程序简介](https://developer.open-douyin.com/docs/resource/zh-CN/thirdparty/API/smallprogram/auth-app-manage/base-info/modify-intro) |\n| 修改小程序名称 | 为授权小程序修改名称 | [修改小程序名称](https://partner.open-douyin.com/docs/resource/zh-CN/thirdparty/API/smallprogram/auth-app-manage/base-info/modify-name) |\n| 修改服务器域名 | 为授权小程序修改服务器域名 | [修改服务器域名](https://developer.open-douyin.com/docs/resource/zh-CN/thirdparty/API/smallprogram/auth-app-manage/base-info/modify-domain) |\n\n这些接口的基本调用形式为：\n```\nPOST https://open.douyin.com/api/v2/thirdparty/auth-app-manage/base-info/modify-intro/\n```\n\n---\n\n### 4. 相关服务端API总览\n\n- 📄 [服务端API介绍_小游戏](https://developer.open-douyin.com/docs/resource/zh-CN/mini-game/develop/server/server-api-introduction)\n- 📄 [小程序OpenAPI SDK总览](https://developer.open-douyin.com/docs/resource/zh-CN/mini-app/develop/server/sdk-overview)\n\n---\n\n### 建议\n\n1. **如果是自研小游戏**：直接在 [抖音开放平台](https://developer.open-douyin.com/) 后台手动修改基础信息。\n2. **如果是第三方代开发**：使用上述第三方平台提供的修改接口。\n3. 如果你确实需要一个类似 `set_app_info` 的批量修改接口，建议在[抖音开放社区](https://developer.open-douyin.com/forum/)发帖咨询或提交需求反馈，确认是否有内部/未公开的API可用。"],"durationSeconds":57.45599929999991,"searchCount":6}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202605240000044dfead909a6149d1","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Based on the search results, for self-developed mini games, the basic info needs to be set through the developer console. There's no public API for setting basic info for self-developed games - only for third-party platform development.\n\nLet me try another approach. Since the cookies work for `microapp.bytedance.com`, I can try using the internal platform API to set the game info. Let me check what internal APIs the developer console uses.\n\nActually, let me try using the open-douyin API with cookies that include the `toutiao.com` domain cookies, and see if the cross-domain cookies work when accessed via the same browser context withtoutiao.com first.\n\nOr better yet, let me try using the toutiao.com API endpoints directly with the cookies. Let me look at the config.json URLs.\n\nActually, I think the simplest approach now is to:\n1. Try using the internal API that the developer console uses to set basic info\n2. Or try to navigate to the developer console via toutiao.com first (which has cookies) and then redirect to open-douyin.com\n\nLet me try approach #2 - use Playwright to first visit toutiao.com (to set cookies), then navigate to open-douyin.com.\n\nActually wait - the cookies are for `.toutiao.com` and `microapp.bytedance.com` domains, but the developer console at `developer.open-douyin.com` needs its own session. These are different domains.\n\nLet me try a different approach: use the toutiao.com platform API to set the basic info. Let me check what endpoints are available on `microapp.bytedance.com`.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"706396d6-ec59-4233-944d-f5f71f1c7830","uuid":"c01f2c59-faea-4a6f-9170-750abb6feab0"}
