{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_2026052400031254cd2143434c44bf","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API approach seems difficult. Let me try yet another approach - use the tma CLI to do the audit directly, and then see if the error message tells us what we need. Actually, let me re-read the task:\n\n> tma audit失败需要先填写基本信息（名称、简介、图标、服务类目）\n\nSo the issue is that `tma audit` fails because basic info isn't filled in. Let me first try running `tma audit` to see what happens, then try to fill in the basic info through the developer console.\n\nActually, let me try a completely different approach. Since the browser cookies don't work for the developer console login, maybe I can:\n1. Use the tma CLI to login and create a session that works in the browser\n2. Or try to launch Edge with the user profile that has the login session\n\nLet me check if Edge has a user profile with the developer console session already logged in. The task description says \"浏览器控制台URL https://developer.open-douyin.com/game-console/1065926/game-manage\" - this suggests the user has already used a browser to access this URL before.\n\nLet me try to launch Edge with the user's profile data.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"706396d6-ec59-4233-944d-f5f71f1c7830","uuid":"11531992-7d79-4f1b-8dd9-e627ccd4cb60"}
