{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260524000647d88904c739fd4582","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the overview page for the game. The flow is:\n1. Step 2: \"完善小游戏基础信息\" (Complete basic info) - Status: \"暂未完成\" (Not yet completed)\n2. There's a \"完善信息\" (Complete info) button that I need to click\n\nLet me click the \"完善信息\" button to go to the form where I can fill in the game's name, icon, description, etc.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"706396d6-ec59-4233-944d-f5f71f1c7830","uuid":"27384c95-f5d3-4c53-a6df-1b5f8b855923"}
