{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202605240016511bd26d70b9844e8e","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the issue! There's a **cropper modal** that appears after uploading the icon. It says \"图标预览\" (Icon Preview) with \"取消\" (Cancel) and \"确定\" (Confirm) buttons. The cropper overlays the image.\n\nI need to:\n1. After uploading the icon, wait for the cropper modal to appear\n2. Click \"确定\" (Confirm) to confirm the cropped icon\n3. Then proceed with the rest of the form\n\nAlso, I noticed the errors went away after waiting: \"Errors after longer wait: []\". So the icon upload did work, but the cropper modal needs to be confirmed.\n\nAlso there's another modal: \"查看详情知道了\" that might also be blocking.\n\nLet me write the final complete script.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"706396d6-ec59-4233-944d-f5f71f1c7830","uuid":"7d90e8d8-3574-4efd-9894-3dc7d9a46b20"}
