{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202605240018067b8514c1f31747cf","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good progress! The form is almost complete:\n- Name: filled (消消消大作战) ✓\n- Summary: filled ✓\n- Icon: uploaded and confirmed ✓ (no icon error)\n- Detailed description: filled ✓\n- Category: selected (休闲益智) ✓\n- Theme tags: **NOT selected** - error: \"请选择小游戏题材\" ✗\n- Draft saved successfully (no save errors)\n\nThe theme tag selection failed because the options were different - they showed \"二次元, 三国, 体育, 现代战争, 古代战争\" instead of \"休闲益智\". These are different selectors. The theme tag selector opens but shows different options than expected.\n\nI need to fix the theme tag selection. Let me look at the available options more carefully and find the right one. Let me also check if there's a way to select the theme tag properly.\n\nLooking at the previous results, the theme tag section had a regular `.semi-dy-open-select` (not a tree select). The options showed: \"二次元, 三国, 体育, 现代战争, 古代战争\" - these look like \"题材标签\" (theme/subject tags) for games. I should look for a tag that matches the game theme, like \"休闲\" or something similar.\n\nLet me create a script that lists all available theme options so I can pick the right one.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"706396d6-ec59-4233-944d-f5f71f1c7830","uuid":"817df330-210b-48c2-b45a-58d6e2d692fd"}
