oking back at the output from the complete-submit.js, the submit was attempted but no confirmation modal appeared. This suggests the submit didn't work, possibly because there's a missing step.\n\nLet me try clicking the submit button more carefully and check if there are any prerequisites we're missing.\n\nActually, let me look at this from a different angle. The error says \"服务类目(服务类目至少有一个通过)\". In the Douyin developer console, \"服务类目\" refers to the service categories that describe what the app does. For games, this might be something like \"游戏 > 休闲益智\" that needs to be set up and approved.\n\nThis is different from the form I was filling. There might be a separate page or section for setting up service categories.\n\nLet me explore the developer console to find this.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"706396d6-ec59-4233-944d-f5f71f1c7830","uuid":"cf671046-e2a9-4fab-bc90-40e94558ef87"}
