{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202605240021530c3f9205c8d84f03","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The settings page still shows \"请先进行完善信息, 才能进行基本信息设置\" (Please complete the information first before you can set basic information). This means the \"完善信息\" form I filled hasn't been formally submitted yet - it was only saved as a draft.\n\nThe issue is:\n1. The \"提交审核\" (Submit for Review) button on the baseinfo page didn't work earlier (no confirmation modal appeared)\n2. The basic info is saved as a draft but not submitted\n3. Without the basic info being formally submitted/approved, the service category can't be set\n\nLet me go back to the baseinfo page and try harder to submit the form. The submit button might need to be double-clicked or there might be additional requirements.\n\nActually, looking at the form again, I recall there were qualification sections at the bottom:\n- 计算机软件著作登记证书 (Software Copyright Certificate)\n- 游戏自审自查报告 (Game Self-review Report)\n- 广电总局版号批文 (Broadcasting Bureau Version Number)\n- 商标或IP资质 (Trademark/IP Qualification)\n\nThese might be blocking the submission. The submit button might be checking all required fields including these qualifications.\n\nBut wait - the form validation showed NO errors. Let me try a different approach:\n1. Click \"提交审核\" and watch carefully for what happens\n2. Maybe there's a hidden requirement or the button needs more interaction\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The \"基本信息\" (basic info) form was saved as a draft. The \"提交审核\" button might need specific conditions. Let me look at what the draft save actually did and try submitting again with more careful observation.\n\nLet me write a focused script that:\n1. Goes to the baseinfo page\n2. Clicks \"提交审核\" with detailed logging\n3. Watches for any dialog, toast, or page changes","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"706396d6-ec59-4233-944d-f5f71f1c7830","uuid":"e371c954-063e-41c2-ae97-a33cc447537d"}
