scription, icon, service category) and then run audit. The audit failure is expected if qualifications aren't ready. Let me focus on properly filling the basic info form and then report the audit result.\n\nLet me write a comprehensive final script that:\n1. Fills ALL text fields correctly\n2. Uploads the icon with cropper confirmation\n3. Selects the correct category (休闲益智)\n4. Selects theme tags\n5. Saves as draft\n6. Attempts submit\n\nAnd then report that:\n- Basic info was filled\n- Audit failed because service category hasn't been approved yet\n- Software copyright and self-review report are still needed","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"706396d6-ec59-4233-944d-f5f71f1c7830","uuid":"391226bd-1b74-4340-9833-02078cd0cf94"}
