{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260524002355adbafe1b69144233","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The file chooser didn't open because the upload button might be hidden (since the icon was previously uploaded). The upload area might show a preview instead of the add button. Let me check if the icon is already uploaded from a previous session (it was confirmed with cropper before).\n\nActually, the issue might be that the previous browser session had already uploaded the icon, and now when we open the page again, the upload add button is replaced with a preview/replace button.\n\nLet me take a different approach. Instead of trying to re-upload the icon, let me check if it's already there and only upload if needed. Also, let me check if there's a \"replace\" button instead.\n\nBut actually, the form data from the previous session was lost (as we saw earlier). The page shows the form fresh each time we open it. But the icon might have been uploaded to the server and is just showing as a preview.\n\nWait, earlier the form showed \"请上传图标\" error, which means the icon wasn't saved to the draft. Let me try a different approach:\n1. Use the file input directly (not the upload button)\n2. Or use force click on the upload area\n\nActually, the issue is that the upload add button might not be visible if there's already a preview. Let me check the current state.\n\nLet me simplify and write a more robust script.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"706396d6-ec59-4233-944d-f5f71f1c7830","uuid":"23a8155a-8097-4356-89bb-8b7cec9c048a"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260524002355adbafe1b69144233","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_d235d51eed964f90b5925823","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"D:/game-projects/douyin-match3/tools/robust-fill.js","content":"const { chromium } = require('playwright');\n\n(async () => {\n  const userDataDir = 'C:\\\\Users\\\\Administrator\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\Edge\\\\User Data';\n  const context = await chromium.launchPersistentContext(userDataDir, {\n    channel: 'msedge',\n    headless: false,\n    viewport: { width: 1280, height: 900 },\n    args: ['--profile-directory=Default'],\n  });\n\n  const page = context.pages()[0] || await context.newPage();\n  await page.goto('https://developer.open-douyin.com/game/tte7a1911c79c6fc8302/baseinfo', {\n    waitUntil: 'domcontentloaded',\n    timeout: 60000,\n  });\n  await page.waitForTimeout(5000);\n  await page.keyboard.press('Escape');\n  await page.waitForTimeout(300);\n  const knowBtn = page.locator('button:has-text(\"知道了\")');\n  if (await knowBtn.isVisible().catch(() => false)) { await knowBtn.click(); await page.waitForTimeout(500); }\n\n  // Check icon state\n  const hasIcon = await page.evaluate(() => !!document.querySelector('[class*=\"upload\"] img'));\n  console.log('Has icon:', hasIcon);\n\n  // Fill text fields\n  console.log('Filling text fields...');\n  await page.locator('#summary').fill('经典三消益智小游戏，轻松有趣的消除挑战等你来玩');\n  await page.locator('#introduction').fill('消消消大作战是一款经典的三消益智小游戏。游戏玩法简单：交换相邻的宝石，将三个或更多相同颜色的宝石连成一线即可消除。消除越多，得分越高！游戏包含多种彩色宝石和钻石形状，画面精美，操作流畅，适合所有年龄段的玩家。通过消除获得高分，挑战自我极限，享受三消带来的无穷乐趣。');\n\n  // Upload icon if needed\n  if (!hasIcon) {\n    console.log('Uploading icon...');\n    // Try both methods\n    try {\n      const addBtn = page.locator('[class*=\"upload-add\"], [class*=\"upload-picture-add\"]').first();\n      if (await addBtn.isVisible().catch(() => false)) {\n        const [fc] = await Promise.all([\n          page.waitForEvent('filechooser', { timeout: 5000 }),\n          addBtn.click(),\n        ]);\n        await fc.setFiles('D:/game-projects/douyin-match3/icon-600.png');\n      }\n    } catch (e) {\n      console.log('Add button method failed, trying hidden input...');\n      const fileInput = page.locator('input[type=\"file\"].semi-dy-open-upload-hidden-input').first();\n      await fileInput.setInputFiles('D:/game-projects/douyin-match3/icon-600.png');\n    }\n    await page.waitForTimeout(3000);\n\n    // Confirm cropper\n    const confirmCropper = await page.$('.semi-dy-open-modal-confirm button');\n    if (confirmCropper) {\n      const text = await confirmCropper.textContent();\n      if (text?.includes('确定')) {\n        console.log('Confirming cropper...');\n        await confirmCropper.click();\n        await page.waitForTimeout(3000);\n      }\n    }\n    await page.keyboard.press('Escape');\n    await page.waitForTimeout(300);\n    if (await knowBtn.isVisible().catch(() => false)) { await knowBtn.click(); await page.waitForTimeout(500); }\n  }\n\n  // Select category\n  console.log('Selecting category...');\n  const treeSelect = await page.$('.semi-dy-open-tree-select');\n  if (treeSelect) {\n    // Click to open\n    await treeSelect.evaluate(el => el.dispatchEvent(new MouseEvent('mousedown', { bubbles: true })));\n    await treeSelect.evaluate(el => el.dispatchEvent(new MouseEvent('mouseup', { bubbles: true })));\n    await treeSelect.evaluate(el => el.dispatchEvent(new MouseEvent('click', { bubbles: true })));\n    await page.waitForTimeout(1000);\n\n    // Find and click 休闲益智\n    const found = await page.evaluate(() => {\n      const opts = document.querySelectorAll('.semi-dy-open-tree-option');\n      for (const o of opts) {\n        if (o.textContent?.trim() === '休闲益智') {\n          o.dispatchEvent(new MouseEvent('click', { bubbles: true }));\n          return true;\n        }\n      }\n      return false;\n    });\n    console.log('Category 休闲益智 found:', found);\n    await page.waitForTimeout(1000);\n  }\n\n  // Select theme tag\n  console.log('Selecting theme tag...');\n  const themeSelectFound = await page.evaluate(() => {\n    const selects = document.querySelectorAll('.semi-dy-open-select');\n    for (const sel of selects) {\n      const ph = sel.querySelector('.semi-dy-open-select-selection-placeholder');\n      if (ph?.textContent?.includes('题材标签')) {\n        sel.dispatchEvent(new MouseEvent('mousedown', { bubbles: true }));\n        sel.dispatchEvent(new MouseEvent('mouseup', { bubbles: true }));\n        sel.dispatchEvent(new MouseEvent('click', { bubbles: true }));\n        return true;\n      }\n    }\n    return false;\n  });\n  if (themeSelectFound) {\n    await page.waitForTimeout(1500);\n    await page.evaluate(() => {\n      const opts = document.querySelectorAll('.semi-dy-open-select-option');\n      for (const o of opts) {\n        if (o.textContent?.trim() === '解压') {\n          o.dispatchEvent(new MouseEvent('click', { bubbles: true }));\n        }\n      }\n    });\n    await page.waitForTimeout(1000);\n  }\n  await page.keyboard.press('Escape');\n  await page.waitForTimeout(500);\n\n  // Check errors\n  const errors = await page.$$eval('[class*=\"error-message\"]', els =>\n    els.map(e => e.textContent?.trim()).filter(t => t && !t.includes('请用') && !t.includes('审核规范') && !t.includes('命名规则'))\n  );\n  console.log('Errors:', errors);\n\n  await page.screenshot({ path: 'D:/game-projects/douyin-match3/screenshots/92-filled.png', fullPage: true });\n\n  // Save draft\n  console.log('Saving draft...');\n  const draftBtn = page.locator('button:has-text(\"存为草稿\")');\n  await draftBtn.scrollIntoViewIfNeeded();\n  await page.waitForTimeout(300);\n  await draftBtn.click({ force: true });\n  await page.waitForTimeout(8000);\n\n  const saveErrors = await page.$$eval('[class*=\"error-message\"]', els =>\n    els.map(e => e.textContent?.trim()).filter(t => t && !t.includes('请用') && !t.includes('审核规范') && !t.includes('命名规则') && t.length < 40)\n  );\n  console.log('Save result errors:', saveErrors);\n\n  // Submit\n  console.log('Submitting...');\n  const submitBtn = page.locator('button:has-text(\"提交审核\")');\n  await submitBtn.scrollIntoViewIfNeeded();\n  await page.waitForTimeout(300);\n  await submitBtn.click({ force: true });\n  await page.waitForTimeout(5000);\n\n  // Check for modal\n  const hasModal = await page.evaluate(() => {\n    const btns = document.querySelectorAll('.semi-dy-open-modal button');\n    for (const b of btns) {\n      const t = b.textContent?.trim();\n      if ((t === '确定' || t === '确认') && b.offsetParent !== null) {\n        b.click();\n        return t;\n      }\n    }\n    return null;\n  });\n  if (hasModal) {\n    console.log('Confirmed modal:', hasModal);\n    await page.waitForTimeout(5000);\n  }\n\n  await page.screenshot({ path: 'D:/game-projects/douyin-match3/screenshots/93-submitted.png', fullPage: true });\n\n  // Check overview\n  await page.goto('https://developer.open-douyin.com/game/tte7a1911c79c6fc8302/indexpage', {\n    waitUntil: 'domcontentloaded', timeout: 30000\n  });\n  await page.waitForTimeout(3000);\n  const overview = await page.evaluate(() => document.body.innerText.substring(0, 1500));\n  console.log('Overview:', overview.substring(0, 800));\n\n  await context.close();\n  console.log('Done');\n})();\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"706396d6-ec59-4233-944d-f5f71f1c7830","uuid":"51bb6ac9-85e6-4678-8732-37fcdc7e028b"}
