{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260524002506ef1db624df20497b","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The form was filled with no errors, draft was saved with no errors, and submit was attempted. But the overview page still shows \"暂未完成\" (not yet completed) for the basic info step.\n\nThis could mean:\n1. The submit didn't actually go through (maybe blocked by qualification requirements)\n2. The submit went through but needs time to process\n3. The draft save was successful but the submit requires additional steps\n\nLooking at the overview, step 2 says \"完善小游戏基础信息 - 补充小游戏上线所需的名称、图标、资质等信息\" - it mentions \"资质等信息\" (qualification information). The qualification documents are required for the basic info to be considered complete:\n- 计算机软件著作登记证书 (Software Copyright Certificate)\n- 游戏自审自查报告 (Game Self-review Report)\n\nThese are blocking the submission. Without them, the form can't be fully submitted.\n\nLet me try to complete the self-review report since it might be just a questionnaire. For the copyright certificate, we'll have to report it as a blocker.\n\nActually, let me check if the \"提交审核\" button on the baseinfo form actually triggered an API call. The overview still shows \"暂未完成\" which suggests the form wasn't formally submitted.\n\nLet me try one more thing - go back to the baseinfo page and check if the submit was actually processed.\n\nActually, I think the real issue is that the \"提交审核\" button requires the qualification documents. Without them, the form validation might pass at the field level but the actual submission is blocked by backend validation.\n\nLet me try to complete the \"游戏自审自查报告\" (Game Self-review Report) by clicking \"去确认\" and filling out the form. This might unblock the submission.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"706396d6-ec59-4233-944