{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260524002551a8906503d2aa4fa5","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see! The self-review form appeared as a modal/section on the same page. It has:\n- Multiple checkboxes (9 total) that say \"确认本游戏已满足上述要求\" (Confirm this game meets the above requirements)\n- I checked all 9 checkboxes\n\nBut I also notice:\n1. The category is STILL showing \"角色扮演 / 修仙\" - this is wrong! It should be \"休闲益智\". The category selection isn't persisting.\n2. The submit button didn't work because there was no confirmation click.\n\nWait, I need to also check the self-review confirm button. The checkboxes are checked, but I need to find and click a \"确认\" or \"提交\" button for the self-review form.\n\nAlso, the category is still wrong - \"角色扮演 / 修仙\". The tree select selection didn't work properly. I think the issue is that the tree select shows a hierarchical structure where:\n- Top level: 角色扮演, 生存, 动作, 休闲益智, etc.\n- Second level: Under 休闲益智 there might be sub-categories\n\nWhen I click \"休闲益智\", it might be expanding the tree instead of selecting it. I need to click on the text/label, not the expand arrow.\n\nBut looking at the form output, it shows \"角色扮演 / 修仙\" which suggests the previous selection was wrong and persisted.\n\nLet me fix both issues:\n1. Fix the category selection\n2. Complete the self-review confirmation","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"706396d6-ec59-4233-944d-f5f71f1c7830","uuid":"59834401-3673-497c-944a-52d1e111a316"}
